{
  "app": "juiceshop",
  "commit": "c9f99228d9d56afb5f5ca7925376292f7fa44b13",
  "method": "Line-level truth from the 'vuln-code-snippet vuln-line <challengeKey...>' markers at the pin (verified format: a trailing comment on the vulnerable line itself; 'start'/'end' bound the snippet, 'neutral-line' and 'hide-*' are context). Item-level metadata joined from data/static/challenges.yml through the challenge key (118 challenges; every marker key resolves). Challenges whose markers sit on identical lines are one row (for example three login-SQLi challenges on one line), so 37 line-annotated challenges are 33 rows. The 81 challenges with no vuln-line marker (business logic, OSINT, forged tokens, anything solved through the UI) are not line-truthable and are not rows; recall is reported on the line-annotated rows and on the lintable=y subset. Built before any linter ran; single author, no independent second table yet.",
  "lintable": "y = a pattern a syntactic rule could flag; maybe = needs data flow or absence detection; n = not visible to a linter (business logic, client route tables, wrappers, commented-out code, or a file type outside the JS/TS lint scope: YAML, Terraform, Solidity, Docker). Decided before the first run.",
